#lang r7rs
;; r7rs-gc threads, stage B (docs/archive/r7rs-gc-threads-plan.md): two
;; threads rendezvous by spinning on flags with no release point between
;; them, allocating as they spin.  Under a collector lock (stage A) the
;; thread holding it would spin forever; under the stop-the-world collector
;; both run, and the gate's collection on every allocation stops each in
;; the middle of its spin.
(import (scheme base) (scheme write) (turmeric rendez))
(display (rendezvous)) (newline)
